docs {
  # List TACOTS Feedback Submissions

  Returns a paginated list of TACOTS scholarship programme feedback submissions. Results can be paginated via `page` and `limit` query parameters.

  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default | Description                                      |
  |-----------|--------|----------|---------|--------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`     | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                        |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`    | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                  |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of TACOTS feedback records.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta":  "pagination": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 25,
      "total": 42
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  | Status                      | Description                                         |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. non-numeric `page`). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                            |
}
